:: Widgets MP Temple Schism [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpTempleSchismInit">>
<<if !$mpTempleOrder>><<set $mpTempleOrder to "neutral">><</if>>
<<set $mpTempleRites to ($mpTempleRites or 0)>>
<<set $mpGrace to ($mpGrace or 0)>>
<<if $mpTempleNextStageDay is undefined>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTempleRite">>
<<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<set _amt to (_args[0] or 1)>>
<<set $mpTempleRites to Math.min(6, Math.max(0, ($mpTempleRites or 0) + _amt))>>
<<set $mpGrace to Math.min(100, Math.max(-100, ($mpGrace or 0) + (_amt * 5)))>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTempleAlign">>
<<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<set _side to (_args[0] or "neutral")>>
<<set $mpTempleOrder to _side>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTempleService">>
<<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>
	<<stress -4>><<set $mpGrace to Math.min(100, ($mpGrace or 0) + 4)>>
<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>
	<<set $mpFogTide to Math.max(0, ($mpFogTide or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpGrace to Math.min(100, ($mpGrace or 0) + 4)>>
<<else>>
	<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTempleTitleCn">>
<<if $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "orthodox_canon">>净火司铎与守律学侣<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "reform_relief">>慈悲司铎与济世执事<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "schism_dual_chairs">>北座戒首与南座慈首<<else>>尚未定名的旧称<</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTempleScheduleCn">>
<<if $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode is "dawn_midnight_watch">>破晓晨祷与子夜封炉两班<<elseif $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode is "day_clinic_open_night">>白昼施粥义诊、入夜敞门留宿<<elseif $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode is "split_odd_even_hours">>单数时辰归北座、双数时辰归南座<<else>>尚未排定的旧钟点<</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpTemplePostResidue">>
<<if $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "orthodox_canon">>长厅里只剩净火一册还摊着，回廊钥匙仍挂在主教腰间。<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "reform_relief">>长厅里只剩慈悲一册还摊着，白昼的粥桌支在侧门边。<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "schism_dual_chairs">>长厅里并排立着两册，单双时辰分占南北回廊。<<else>>长厅里的封蜡还没有落定。<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP Temple Schism Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
回廊与钟塔之间的窄厅从拱顶裂到踢脚，左墙钉着净火戒律的黑漆木牌，右墙插满慈悲圣所的领粮条与病家便笺。旧书桌上的六瓣铜环亮着 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 粒石子，恩典记着 <<print $mpGrace>>。你眼下归属<<if $mpTempleSchismEnded>>已封蜡定局的<</if>><<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>净火正统<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>慈悲圣所<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "concord">>双生调和<<else>>尚未落印的中立位<</if>>。<<if Time.days lt ($mpTempleNextStageDay or 0)>>下一场仪轨要等到第 <<print $mpTempleNextStageDay>> 日。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt ($mpTempleNextStageDay or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[等仪轨日再来 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<elseif ($mpTempleRites or 0) lt 1>>
<<templeicon>><<link [[跟唱晨祷圣咏 (0:12)|MP Temple Rites 1]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去长厅旁听两派 (0:08)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<elseif ($mpTempleRites or 0) lt 3>>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[守暗渠口夜守 (0:15)|MP Temple Rites 2]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去长厅旁听两派 (0:08)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<else>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去长厅听两派 (0:08)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[进裂后教务司 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Hub]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</if>>

:: MP Temple Rites 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
天还没亮透，前殿长椅上已经坐了一排晨祷的人，值夜修士换上一排细白新烛。约旦站在祭坛侧阶翻开圣典，等你手里的铜牌（当前仪轨 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 格、恩典 <<print $mpGrace>>）跟上第一个音；侧廊右手的告解木栅也掀开了半寸帘子。晨祷靠的是沉稳心神，听告解则要在木栅后默默担下旁人的苦楚。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回裂缝总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[跟唱晨祷圣咏 (0:12)|MP Temple Rites 1 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<if $daily.mpTempleRite1Fail>><<set $mpTempleRiteRes to "chant_fail">><<stress 2>><<elseif Time.days gte ($mpTempleNextStageDay or 0) and (($willpower or 0) gte 320 or $mpGrace gte 1)>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpTempleRite 1>><<mpTempleService>><<set $mpTempleRiteRes to "chant_ok">><<else>><<set $daily.mpTempleRite1Fail to 1>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 3>><<set $mpGrace to Math.max(-100, ($mpGrace or 0) - 3)>><<set $mpTempleRiteRes to "chant_fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[守在隔栅后听告解 (0:12)|MP Temple Rites 2]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpTempleRite 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Rites 1 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if $mpTempleRiteRes is "chant_ok">>
你沉住腹底气息跟住领唱的每一个转折，晨钟余音在彩窗间回荡。铜环随之再亮一格，恩典添上新墨，散场后连管仪的修士也向你微微颔首。
<<stress -3>>
<<else>>
唱到中段高音时你胸口发紧，节拍慢了半拍，被管仪修士客客气气请到侧廊长椅坐下喝温水休整，本轮未能添上仪轨。
<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
回廊高处的彩窗透下微凉天光，铜环上的石子在烛影里泛着温润光泽。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回裂缝总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[转往暗渠口夜守 (0:06)|MP Temple Rites 2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Rites 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
入夜后的巡礼沿着回廊石阶向下，直抵暗渠入口的长明灯座。当前铜环仪轨为 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 格，雾潮水尺停在 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。夜守比晨祷更苛刻，人得在潮湿的石阶上坐满整夜，听着水声涨落按时添入净火石脂；只有仪轨够深或惯于照料活物的人，守门修士才敢放你下去。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回裂缝总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<if Time.days gte ($mpTempleNextStageDay or 0) and ($mpTempleRites gte 2 or ($tending or 0) gte 220)>><<link [[守暗渠口夜守 (0:15)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 4>><<mpTempleRite 2>><<mpTempleService>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[夜寒暂退 (0:15)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 15>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpTempleRite2Fail to 1>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 4>><<set $mpGrace to Math.max(-100, ($mpGrace or 0) - 2)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去长厅旁听两派议 (0:06)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Factions [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
回廊尽头的长厅里，净火正统与慈悲圣所面对面摊开名册与领粮条。铜牌上记着仪轨 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 格、恩典 <<print $mpGrace>>，归属为<<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>净火正统<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>慈悲圣所<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "concord">>双生调和<<else>>尚未落定<</if>>。三枚封蜡要仪轨满三格、恩典够五分（或备下£2.00调和底金），且不在仪轨冷却期内，管仪修士才肯递蜡勺；你也可先下钟塔改称谓与轮值。
<br><br>
<<set _templeEndOpen to (($mpTempleRites or 0) gte 3 and (($mpGrace or 0) gte 5 or ($money or 0) gte 200) and Time.days gte ($mpTempleNextStageDay or 0))>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpTempleSchismEnded>>
<<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">><<templeicon>><<link [[重温净火正统约 (0:06)|MP Temple Ending Orthodoxy]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">><<socialiseicon>><<link [[重温慈悲圣所约 (0:06)|MP Temple Ending Sanctuary]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<mpritualicon>><<link [[重温双生调和约 (0:06)|MP Temple Ending Concord]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<elseif _templeEndOpen>>
<<templeicon>><<link [[支持净火派 (0:15)|MP Temple Ending Orthodoxy]]>><<pass 15>><<mpTempleAlign "orthodox">><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[支持慈悲圣所 (0:15)|MP Temple Ending Sanctuary]]>><<pass 15>><<mpTempleAlign "reform">><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[促成双生圣咏和 (0:15)|MP Temple Ending Concord]]>><<pass 15>><<mpTempleAlign "concord">><</link>><br>
<<else>><span class="disabled">支持净火 / 慈悲 / 双生调和 (0:15)（需仪轨≥3、恩典≥5或£2.00底金，且无仪轨冷却）</span><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[进裂后教务司改制 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Hub]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Ending Orthodoxy [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if !$mpTempleSchismEnded>><<set $mpTempleSchismEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldPriceMod to Math.min(160, ($mpWorldPriceMod or 100) + 3)>><</if>><<mpTempleAlign "orthodox">><<set $mpWorldTempleOutcome to "orthodox">>
黑漆戒律名册在主祭坛上正式落印，神殿账目从此只认登册审查。回廊钥匙重新挂回主教腰间的铜环，庇护所门闩加厚，净火石脂优先灌入地下暗渠压低雾潮，全城百钱供品实付 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>。侧廊的喧哗被彻底肃清，晨钟与晚祷恢复了毫厘不差的严苛旧制。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回裂缝总枢 (0:04)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[返回神殿深区总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Ending Sanctuary [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if !$mpTempleSchismEnded>><<set $mpTempleSchismEnded to 1>><<set $mpFogTide to Math.min(7, ($mpFogTide or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<mpTempleAlign "reform">><<set $mpWorldTempleOutcome to "reformed">>
慈悲圣所的领粮册取代了黑漆木牌，回廊不再落锁，旧谱室与侧廊长椅向所有没有推荐信的夜归人敞开。净火石脂省下来熬药温粥，街面物价随之回落，百钱实付 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>。虽然暗渠水位退得慢了些，但神殿前殿门口的粥桶整夜冒着白汽。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回裂缝总枢 (0:04)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回神殿深区总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Ending Concord [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if !$mpTempleSchismEnded>><<set $mpTempleSchismEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldTempleOutcome to "concord">><<set $money to Math.max(0, ($money or 0) - 200)>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<mpTempleAlign "concord">><<set $mpGrace to Math.min(100, ($mpGrace or 0) + 10)>>
两派在双生圣咏的尾音里各退半步，神殿账目分作左右两栏并排记账：回廊钥匙由两派各持一半，同时到场方能开锁；庇护所分出里外两间，兼顾守戒学侣与街坊病家。你的恩典升至 <<print $mpGrace>>，主教与约旦的人都留在了同一座屋檐下。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回裂缝总枢 (0:04)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[返回神殿深区总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Post Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<set $mpTempleNpcTitleMode to ($mpTempleNpcTitleMode or "")>><<set $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode to ($mpTempleNpcScheduleMode or "")>>
钟塔下的裂后教务司守着神殿的称谓谱与轮值钟点。铜牌上雾潮水尺停在 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格，行会宵禁修正记着 <<print ($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod) or 0>>，长厅门缝里透出封蜡气味。眼下殿里互称<<mpTempleTitleCn>>，轮值按<<mpTempleScheduleCn>>走。<<if $mpWorldTempleSchismLocked>><br><br><<mpTemplePostResidue>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回议事 (0:02)|MP Temple Factions]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if !$mpWorldTempleSchismLocked>>
<<templeicon>><<link [[去净火教宪卷 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Orthodox 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去慈悲新制案卷 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Reform 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[翻看双座分廊断章 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Schism 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "orthodox_canon">>
<<templeicon>><<link [[去净火教宪卷 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Orthodox 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "reform_relief">>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去慈悲新制案卷 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Reform 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpTempleNpcTitleMode is "schism_dual_chairs">>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[翻看双座分廊断章 (0:10)|MP Temple Post Schism 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[翻看裂后余档 (0:06)|MP Temple Schism More Hub B]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Temple Post Orthodox 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
戒律长老把黑漆名册搬上主祭坛，提议将神殿神职统一改称为「净火司铎」与「守律学侣」，全殿作息改为破晓晨祷与子夜封炉两班。铜牌上的水尺停在 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格，恩典记着 <<print $mpGrace>>。正统派要求先灌石脂封死暗渠，再用严苛戒条弹压侧廊异议，彻底废除夜间散漫的留宿旧例。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教务 (0:02)|MP Temple Post Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[颁行净火司铎称谓 (0:14)|MP Temple Post Orthodox 2]]>><<pass 14>><<if $mpGrace gte 5 or $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">><<set $mpTemplePChoice to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTemplePChoice to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[强排子夜守炉班 (0:14)|MP Temple Post Orthodox 2]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpTemplePChoice to "force">><</link>>

:: MP Temple Post Orthodox 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if $mpWorldTempleSchismLocked>>
教务司的封蜡早已落定，这一卷章程只在首次落印时改过殿内称谓与排班，此后不再改动。
<<elseif $mpTemplePChoice is "fail">>
<<set $mpGrace to Math.max(-100, ($mpGrace or 0) - 4)>><<set $mpTempleRites to Math.max(0, ($mpTempleRites or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 2>>你的恩典尚不足以服众，执事们拒绝附署并扣减了一格仪轨石子，长老合上黑漆名册让你隔日再议。
<<else>>
<<set $mpWorldTempleSchismLocked to 1>><<set $mpTempleNpcTitleMode to "orthodox_canon">><<set $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode to "dawn_midnight_watch">><<mpTempleAlign "orthodox">><<set $mpFogTide to Math.max(0, ($mpFogTide or 0) - 2)>>
红蜡落定，全殿神职正式改称「净火司铎」与「守律学侣」，轮值锁死为破晓晨祷与子夜封炉两班，另两条改制路线就此封存。<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("temple_post_v47")>><<money 1000>><</if>><<stress -4>>
<</if>>
回廊高处的彩窗透下微凉天光，铜环上的石子在烛影里泛着温润光泽。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教务 (0:02)|MP Temple Post Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转入软结局静修 (0:06)|MP Temple Post Soft End]]>><<pass 6>><<if $mpTemplePChoice is "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回看神殿裂缝总枢 (0:04)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Temple Post Soft End [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
你退到侧廊安静的长椅上饮下一杯温水，听着钟塔上传来的风声。本轮裂后改制暂未合拢，也未发放任何香油津贴，但你已摸清正统、改革与裂宗三套称谓及作息班表的症结所在。手里的铜牌上仪轨记着 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 格，恩典记着 <<print $mpGrace>>，稍事休整后即可重返教务司再度议定。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[重返裂后教务司 (0:04)|MP Temple Post Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[翻阅神殿裂缝副页 (0:04)|MP Temple Schism More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
